      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "UPON the Court of Appeal Claim Form dated 29 August 2025 (the \"Claim\")",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "AND UPON the Appellant's Appeal Notice dated 22 July 2025 in CFI-073-2024 (the \"Appeal\")",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "AND UPON the Respondent's application for permission to cross appeal dated 18 September 2025 in",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "CA-005-2025 (the \"Claimant's application for permission to cross appeal\")",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "AND UPON hearing Counsel for the Appellant and hearing Counsel for the Respondent at the Appeal",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "hearing held before H.E. Chief Justice Wayne Martin, H.E. Justice Rene Le Miere and H.E. Justice Sir",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "Peter Gross (the \"Hearing)",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "IT IS HEREBY ORDERED THAT:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "For reasons to be published in due course:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "1. The Appeal is allowed and the application for security is remitted to the Court of First Instance (CFI)",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p1-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "for reconsideration on the terms set out in these orders.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. Pending reconsideration by the CFl, the order for security will remain in place, and any security",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "posted pursuant to its terms will be maintained unless and until varied or revoked by the CFI following",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "the remittal of the application.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. Any findings or conclusions of the judge at first instance on the following matters:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(a) the portion of the proceedings to be covered by the security,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(b) the posting or staging of further security,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(c) the existence of any natural barrier or cap on the amount of security,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(d) the assessment of whether an order for security would risk stifling the claim,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(e) the effect of the Claimant's success on the Strike out application on the provision of security for",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "the remainder of the case,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(f) any proposition that the presence of a litigation funder automatically entitles the Claimant to a",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "reduction in the amount of the security to be posted, and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(g) the assessment of the quantum of the security to be provided, are set aside.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "4. The Claimant's application for permission to cross appeal is dismissed.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "5. The CFl is to deal with the remitted application for security on the basis that:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(a) the jurisdictional conditions for the grant of security have been satisfied; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(b) the issues identified in Order 3and the issues pertaining to the proposed cross appeal have",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "been determined adversely to the Claimant as at the time of the original application for security",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "For the avoidance of doubt, nothing in these orders prevents the Claimant from raising any argument",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "based on the Crabtree principle if and when the question of security is reconsidered following the filing",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "of a counterclaim by the Defendant.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Otherwise, the quantum, timing and terms of the security to be posted by the Claimant are matters to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "be left to the determination of the CFI on the remitted application.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "6. The order that there be no order in respect of the costs of the application for security is set aside",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "and it is ordered that the costs of the application for security up to and including the determination by",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "the judge at first instance will be costs in the case.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "7. The Claimant shall pay the Defendant's costs of:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(a) the initial application for permission to appeal;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(b) the renewed application for permission to appeal;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(c) the application for permission to cross-appeal; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p2-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(d) the appeal;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p3-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "assessed and fixed in the amount of AED 550,000, to be paid within 14 days. If not paid in full within",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p3-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "that period, interest shall accrue on any unpaid amount at the rate prescribed in respect of judgments",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p3-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "of the Court.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p3-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "8. The Defendant's application for permission to appeal against the costs order made by the judge at",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "03b621728fe29eb6113fcdb57f6458d793fd2d5c5b833ae26d40f04a29c85359-p3-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "first instance is dismissed as moot.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
